            "action_name": {
              "value": "Elongate Tongue"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The penanggalan's tongue extends, the membrane stretching and becoming translucent. Until the end of the turn, the penanggalan's proboscis tongue Strikes have a 10-foot reach, and any target is flat-footed against the Strike unless it has a Perception DC of 22 or higher or the ability to precisely sense invisible things."
